   <text type="letter">
      <body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1"/>
            <opener><rs ref="#tillich_place_id__1354" type="place">Ridgewood N.J.</rs>
               <salute><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Dr. Tillich</rs>,</salute>
            </opener>
            <p>you and your communist loving gang are a disgrace to this ministry. I am a
               Presbyterian but I heartily congratulate <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1390"
               type="person">Dr. Niebuhr</rs> on his courageous stand against the <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1640"
               type="person">Third Term Scoundrel</rs> in the White House. If the money stolen to
               <unclear>milk of</unclear> the New Deal had been devoted to National defense,
               there would he no <unclear>bullet</unclear> today.</p>
            <closer>
               <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__870" type="person"
                  >Charles <unclear>Con</unclear> Henkel</rs></signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
